auto cursor-default" data-component-part="accordion-content"><span data-as="p">Run <code>/mcp</code>, select the server, and choose <code>Authenticate</code> again. If the browser doesn’t open automatically, copy the URL shown in the terminal and open it manually. See <a class="link" href="/docs/en/mcp#authenticate-with-remote-mcp-servers">Authenticate with remote MCP servers</a> for fixed callback ports and pre-configured credentials.</span></div></details></div>
